cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "MyoAdapt: Open-Source CPU-Native sEMG Pattern Recognition Platform"
abstract: >
  MyoAdapt is an open-source Python platform for surface
  electromyography (sEMG) pattern recognition with emphasis on
  zero-calibration cross-subject generalization, adversarial domain
  adaptation (Lite-DAN), edge deployment via ONNX, audit-ready
  explainability via SHAP, and reproducible research across the
  NinaPro DB1/DB2/DB3/DB7, CapgMyo, and UCI datasets. Designed to
  run on CPU-native hardware for low-resource environments and edge
  deployment scenarios.
authors:
